    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c9d716e0-c26e-58ca-8f4b-3c8825abdee5" activityNameId="6660ae01-f3d6-5f0f-ad7f-daac83c99c79" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Export cable, 220kV, offshore wind farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Export cable, 220kV, offshore wind farm
UUID=b82390d4-b132-3b8a-a999-f80ad57b4e25
Export cable for a 740 MW offshore wind farm (one of three parallel export cables).
Included processes: manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement.
Data are based on the IEA reference offshore wind farm, derived in the IEA Wind Task 55.
The modelled cable has a conductor cross-sectional area of 1’000 mm2 and refers to one cable out of three the parallel exports cables used for the wind farm.

Main data source: 
Kainz, S. (2025). Life Cycle Inventory of the IEA Wind 740-10-MW Reference Offshore Wind Plant with irregular layout [Dataset]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/ZENODO.15880601
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b82390d4-b132-3b8a-a999-f80ad57b4e25.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
